<decompilertest>
<binaryimage arch="x86:LE:16:Real Mode">
<!--
    Segment user-ops in 16-bit real mode (`option segmentize on|off`), ida95-56.

    Stage P3 simplification-quiescence. Ghidra's ActionSegmentize and
    RuleSegment were stubs, and the pspec <segmentop> was never decoded, so
    every segment-relative access stayed a `segment(base, inner)` user-op.

      mov ax,0x1000; mov ds,ax; mov word [0x10],0x1234; call helper; ret
      helper: ret

    Pass 1 (`segmentize off`, the bug): the call's return-address push is a
    store through segment(ss, sp), and the DS store is segment(0x1000,0x10).
    Pass 2 (default, the fix): the push is a stack access the call absorbs,
    and the store is to the folded linear address 0x10010.
    Pass 3: a BIOS image (bios_realmode_test.S) loaded as the CLI's BIOS front
    end loads it: segment F000 at 0xf0000, `CS` tracked, entered at the reset
    vector. The far jump reaches the POST code and its near calls resolve inside
    segment F000 (`ia.sinc` 16-bit `rel16`), with no segment user-op left.
-->
<bytechunk space="ram" offset="0x1000">
b800108ed8c70610003412e80100c3c3
</bytechunk>
<symbol space="ram" offset="0x1000" name="init_ds"/>
<symbol space="ram" offset="0x100f" name="helper"/>
</binaryimage>
<script>
  <com>option segmentize off</com>
  <com>lo fu init_ds</com>
  <com>decompile</com>
  <com>print C</com>
  <com>option segmentize on</com>
  <com>lo fu init_ds</com>
  <com>decompile</com>
  <com>print C</com>
  <com>clear architecture</com>
  <com>load raw x86:LE:16:Real_Mode 0xf0000 0xffff0 decompiler/crates/kuna-analysis/tests/fixtures/bios_realmode_test.bin</com>
  <com>set track CS 0xf000 0xf0000 0x100000</com>
  <com>load addr 0xffff0</com>
  <com>decompile</com>
  <com>print C</com>
</script>
<stringmatch name="SEGMENTIZE #1: off, the DS store is a segment user-op" min="1" max="1">segment\(0x1000,0x10\) = 0x1234;</stringmatch>
<stringmatch name="SEGMENTIZE #2: off, the call's return-address push is a store" min="1" max="1">segment\(v[0-9]+,v[0-9]+\) = 0x100e;</stringmatch>
<stringmatch name="SEGMENTIZE #3: on, the store is to the folded linear address (pass 2 and the BIOS)" min="2" max="2">dat_10010 = 0x1234;</stringmatch>
<stringmatch name="SEGMENTIZE #4: no push survives the rewrite" min="1" max="1">= 0x100e;</stringmatch>
<stringmatch name="SEGMENTIZE #5: the BIOS reset path calls its POST routine in segment F000" min="2" max="2">  sub_fe000\(\);</stringmatch>
<stringmatch name="SEGMENTIZE #6: the segment user-ops (three lines) are all in the off pass" min="3" max="3">segment\(</stringmatch>
</decompilertest>
